Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.75,0:00:05.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They managed to get in...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.28,0:00:07.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Diting couldn't defeat them?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.81,0:00:12.03,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,They aren't strong. They just copied themselves, and Diting fell for it.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.03,0:00:14.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you can drive them away easily, can't you?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.48,0:00:17.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't leave this place for a hundred years.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.14,0:00:19.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or get involved with outside affairs.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.59,0:00:21.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doesn't "this place" mean Blue Creek?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.52,0:00:23.99,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,It's not even the mountain. I must stay in the tower.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.74,0:00:26.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How many years are left?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.08,0:00:28.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sixty, seventy.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.75,0:00:29.24,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You make your own life harder.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.88,0:00:31.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you help drive them away,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.73,0:00:34.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll help you get your real form back as a reward.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.36,0:00:35.83,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deal!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.86,0:00:42.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which way?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.76,0:00:44.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Straight ahead is Mount Laojun.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.59,0:00:45.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That way, the Grand Dipper Palace.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.90,0:00:46.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That way, the Imperial Lockup Palace.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.82,0:00:47.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We go there.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.74,0:00:49.74,Episode title 11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(554,556)}Blue Creek
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.07,0:00:52.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you like it?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.52,0:00:53.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hi, Laozi.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.72,0:00:55.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's Gen?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.76,0:00:57.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I sent them to run an errand.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.91,0:00:59.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's work together now!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.43,0:01:00.16,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.81,0:01:02.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll sign with my eyes.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.61,0:01:03.61,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's too hard...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.92,0:01:12.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why is it that we always have to wait at doors?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.70,0:01:16.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this the place?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.00,0:01:18.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's nothing here.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.58,0:01:21.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a hole, isn't there?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.65,0:01:24.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me this is the Imperial Lockup Palace.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.35,0:01:25.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just get inside first.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.96,0:01:28.81,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Even if Laozi doesn't intervene,\Nyou can't seal his realm for long.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.26,0:01:30.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get on with it!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.09,0:01:33.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.06,0:01:36.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You like that magazine too?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.60,0:01:37.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I also love it.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.82,0:01:39.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,ONLY comes next week, wanna go?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.70,0:01:41.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't go out.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.17,0:01:44.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No good?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.22,0:01:46.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This seal is rather complicated.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.76,0:01:47.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It can take a long time.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.11,0:01:52.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,May I ask you to leave?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.08,0:01:54.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How come someone else is here?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.93,0:01:55.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.84,0:01:56.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We must fight!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.14,0:02:01.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ice magic!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.79,0:02:03.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Space magic?!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.84,0:02:05.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What were you like at 10?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.78,0:02:07.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't remember.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.70,0:02:07.96,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That space magic is quite troublesome!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.96,0:02:08.17,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it requires a magical artifact.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.17,0:02:08.38,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They can return instantly to where the artifact is.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.38,0:02:08.75,Animal Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,While attacking, pay attention to the movement of the artifact!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.45,0:02:10.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Things I usually do?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.53,0:02:14.95,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Read books, prepare the elixir of immortality, surf the internet...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.34,0:02:17.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does the Jade Emperor exist?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.54,0:02:18.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.46,0:02:19.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about the heavenly court?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.99,0:02:20.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Also no.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.84,0:02:22.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then the myths are not true?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.84,0:02:23.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Some of them are.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.67,0:02:29.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't make noise inside a temple! Come back!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.12,0:02:29.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.85,0:02:31.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does Sun Wukong exist?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.15,0:02:32.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.12,0:02:34.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really? Is he super strong?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.57,0:02:35.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not that strong.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.83,0:02:37.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't he the Great Sage Equal to Heaven?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.23,0:02:38.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's only in the novel.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.51,0:02:40.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You read Journey to the West?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.88,0:02:42.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When it was first published.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.28,0:02:44.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.64,0:02:47.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.64,0:02:48.84,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Water would have been better...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.04,0:02:50.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have no eyebrows.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.32,0:02:51.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have no nose.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.83,0:02:57.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a deadlock. He has the advantage.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.18,0:02:59.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We must use the Firestorm!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.98,0:03:01.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our last resort...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.23,0:03:02.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Darn all this teleportation!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.43,0:03:04.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They try to use the Firestorm?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.29,0:03:06.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come here!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.31,0:03:10.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He absorbed it!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.34,0:03:11.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How is this possible?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.41,0:03:12.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It should cancel ice magic!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.54,0:03:14.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it you...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.14,0:03:16.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lord Xuanli?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.47,0:03:17.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You flatter me.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.90,0:03:18.41,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're quite famous.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.60,0:03:20.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Another spirit beast! We have no chance.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.22,0:03:22.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse our intrusion.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.70,0:03:23.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are leaving now.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.10,0:03:24.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.10,0:03:25.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are we really...?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.71,0:03:26.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.33,0:03:29.46,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is your name that effective?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.81,0:03:32.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't think so, they tricked Diting too.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.03,0:03:32.50,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Follow them!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.81,0:03:34.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's the restroom?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.13,0:03:36.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's none.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.59,0:03:38.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How come?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.87,0:03:40.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ever seen an immortal use the toilet?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.27,0:03:41.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.22,0:03:46.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you trust us?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.00,0:03:48.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's part of my job.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.08,0:03:48.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave now.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.13,0:03:51.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I need to ask for your forgiveness again.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.25,0:03:52.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We will apologize after it happened.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.04,0:03:56.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Darn!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.29,0:04:04.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've messed it up.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.30,0:04:07.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They fell for the same as Diting.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.29,0:04:09.67,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai is outside!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.77,0:04:11.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? Why did she go outside?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.57,0:04:12.10,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To pee...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.37,0:04:15.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's another entrance we can use!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.81,0:04:16.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Follow me!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.38,0:04:18.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Much better!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.21,0:04:21.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.96,0:04:25.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Another person?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.14,0:04:27.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this a side-scrolling game?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.64,0:04:29.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No one told us about this!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:29.22,0:04:30.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll stop her. You go on!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.74,0:04:31.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hope she's no spirit beast!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.97,0:04:35.78,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.07,0:04:36.82,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take my spirit part back!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.52,0:04:58.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.97,0:05:25.60,Episode title 12,,0,0,0,,{\pos(482,620)}Collection of Twelve
Dialogue: 1,0:05:34.63,0:05:35.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think this is a human!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.84,0:05:36.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.47,0:05:39.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's so fast!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.76,0:05:43.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, you came just in time!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.32,0:05:46.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now you look even less like a cat.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.71,0:05:47.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is Xiaobai all right?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:47.92,0:05:48.58,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.41,0:05:49.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gen!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.34,0:05:50.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.42,0:05:54.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here's our chance!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.43,0:05:57.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no chance.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.29,0:05:58.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the...?!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.76,0:06:14.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still want to fight?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.86,0:06:18.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We surrender, we really do.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.17,0:06:21.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Summer must be cool with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:25.01,0:06:26.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did you come here?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.89,0:06:28.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laozi once said,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.27,0:06:29.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that whoever forces him to attack,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:29.73,0:06:31.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,will get the Pure Black Elixir.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.39,0:06:31.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.91,0:06:34.12,Text D4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(766,840)}Book of Vows
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.90,0:06:33.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did I say that?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:34.60,0:06:36.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then why did you want to break into the palace?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:37.39,0:06:38.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laozi once said,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.80,0:06:40.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that whoever breaks into the palace,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.18,0:06:41.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,will get the Green Soul Fruit.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:41.99,0:06:43.33,Internal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must be quite lonely...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.34,0:06:45.34,Text D4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(766,840)}Book of Vows
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.68,0:06:45.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.20,0:06:46.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.57,0:06:48.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A Soul Calling Stone.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:49.11,0:06:51.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please accept it. I hope you can forgive us.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:51.71,0:06:53.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all because of Master Lao's vow book.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.31,0:06:55.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's me who should ask for your forgiveness.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.10,0:06:56.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're being too kind.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.70,0:06:59.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are we allowed to leave now?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:59.65,0:07:00.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.51,0:07:00.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can go.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.78,0:07:02.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are grateful.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:05.27,0:07:06.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are they bad guys?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.38,0:07:08.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.54,0:07:10.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:11.41,0:07:13.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is Xiaohei too a spirit?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.60,0:07:14.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.05,0:07:15.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did he scare you?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.39,0:07:19.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know he only wanted to protect me.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.20,0:07:21.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened to him?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.83,0:07:23.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He just got a little weak.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.30,0:07:24.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like Piyu, after he transforms.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.88,0:07:25.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.86,0:07:27.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So Piyu's a spirit too?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:27.95,0:07:28.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.03,0:07:30.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the anatomy of the dumpling mouse.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.95,0:07:31.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.48,0:07:33.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:33.61,0:07:35.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If Piyu transformed in the forest...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.33,0:07:37.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I couldn't help him.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.03,0:07:40.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you miss him much?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:40.59,0:07:41.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.43,0:07:43.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But he's home now.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.01,0:07:45.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He must be very happy.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.21,0:07:59.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is he all right?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.05,0:08:00.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.27,0:08:02.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He forced himself to transform.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.88,0:08:04.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inflicted wounds upon wounds.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:04.17,0:08:05.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? Is it that serious?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.76,0:08:06.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not particularly.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.00,0:08:08.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But he'll lose some years of {\i1}cultivation{\i0}.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.07,0:08:09.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.18,0:08:12.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say his old wounds made him lose HP.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:12.45,0:08:14.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then this one reduced his HP gauge.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.45,0:08:14.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:15.17,0:08:16.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With my abilities,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.18,0:08:17.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can only help him slowly recover.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.18,0:08:19.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all, I'm not a healer.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.29,0:08:21.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think you are.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.76,0:08:22.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.06,0:08:22.15,Text D,,0,0,0,,{\frz288\fs80\an7\pos(1602,58)}Year 13 of Wuxian
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.06,0:08:22.48,Text D,,0,0,0,,{\fs80\pos(976,752)}239.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.06,0:08:22.65,Text D,,0,0,0,,{\frz280.2\pos(668,542)}The one who hunts\Nthe White-Feathered Silkie
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.06,0:08:22.65,Text D,,0,0,0,,{\frz281\pos(474,382)}will get
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.06,0:08:22.65,Text D,,0,0,0,,{\frz279\pos(548,854)}the Silk Phoenix Elixir
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.40,0:08:23.82,Text D,,0,0,0,,{\fs80\frz12.23\pos(1834,484)}237.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.48,0:08:23.82,Text D,,0,0,0,,{\frz289\pos(1592,442)}Those who collect the inscriptions\Nfrom all the memorial arches in town
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.56,0:08:23.82,Text D,,0,0,0,,{\frz285\pos(1388,356)}will get
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.56,0:08:23.82,Text D,,0,0,0,,{\frz285\pos(1522,778)}the Black Gold Elixir
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.65,0:08:23.82,Text D,,0,0,0,,{\fs80\pos(984,750)}238.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.73,0:08:23.82,Text D,,0,0,0,,{\frz280.8\pos(668,568)}Those who beat me three times\Nin a row in five-in-a-row
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.73,0:08:23.82,Text D,,0,0,0,,{\frz281\pos(482,384)}will get
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.73,0:08:23.82,Text D,,0,0,0,,{\frz279\pos(564,838)}a Laozi statue
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.87,0:08:26.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.83,0:08:28.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is he healed?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:28.71,0:08:29.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.93,0:08:31.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It will take about a month.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:31.92,0:08:33.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then he must stay here with you?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.04,0:08:34.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.06,0:08:36.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll give the cure to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.79,0:08:38.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can take care of him at home.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:38.65,0:08:40.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why had you made so many vows?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.64,0:08:42.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because I'm so lonely!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.51,0:08:44.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Immortal life must be really boring...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.72,0:08:47.95,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,But I made even my latest vows many decades ago.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:48.34,0:08:49.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No wonder even I forgot about them.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.11,0:08:50.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And recently?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.89,0:08:51.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now I've got company.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:52.16,0:08:52.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean Diting?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.11,0:08:54.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean the internet.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:54.96,0:08:55.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:55.81,0:08:57.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you know a certain Fairy Qingning?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.47,0:09:02.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's just...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.30,0:09:04.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,a wishful thought of mine.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.04,0:09:06.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She didn't go out with you?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:06.37,0:09:07.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,None of your business.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.61,0:09:08.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't you an immortal?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.09,0:09:10.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's so great about it?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.01,0:09:12.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Were you always an immortal?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.85,0:09:14.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just a title.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.51,0:09:16.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm a kind of spirit too.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.82,0:09:18.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.84,0:09:20.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If they master the powers of nature,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.81,0:09:22.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,any sentient being can attain the title of god.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.17,0:09:24.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So even a human can become a god?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.08,0:09:28.16,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Sure, even the mightiest god of the present era was once a human.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.49,0:09:29.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.91,0:09:30.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.17,0:09:30.75,Text D2,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(540,362)}Xiaobai's worldview
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.17,0:09:30.34,Text D2,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(455,410)}Back up
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.17,0:09:30.51,Text D2,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(455,540)}Refresh
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.17,0:09:30.75,Text D2,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(455,680)}Rebuild
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.17,0:09:30.76,Text D2,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(455,786)}Deac-\Ntivate
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.33,0:09:30.51,Text D3,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(455,410)}Back up
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.50,0:09:30.76,Text D3,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(455,540)}Refresh
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.51,0:09:30.76,Text D2,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(455,410)}Back up
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.61,0:09:34.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But he was born hundreds of years ago.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:35.03,0:09:38.89,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,People of today have lost the connection to the powers of nature.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.57,0:09:42.28,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,But if you ask, who are\Nthe mightiest beings of all time,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.28,0:09:44.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it may well be that people of today are.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.36,0:09:47.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've digressed.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.68,0:09:48.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's getting rather late.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.90,0:09:50.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I should send you home now.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.51,0:09:51.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.03,0:09:54.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I visit you again someday?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.65,0:09:55.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:55.61,0:09:57.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can bring you anime merchandise!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:58.07,0:09:58.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.67,0:10:02.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I give this Blue Jade Disc to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.91,0:10:04.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let it be the seal of our friendship.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.38,0:10:06.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure? Isn't this a...?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.80,0:10:07.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:07.63,0:10:08.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The old man's in a good mood.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.27,0:10:11.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And what's this for?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.19,0:10:13.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can come here with it.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.97,0:10:15.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xuanli will show you how.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:16.31,0:10:17.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Laozi!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.20,0:10:18.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll visit you often.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.44,0:10:19.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just don't lose it.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.92,0:10:20.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:21.39,0:10:23.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Master, we have to say goodbye now.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:24.28,0:10:25.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.19,0:10:40.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There we are.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.28,0:10:46.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.42,0:10:47.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We teleported!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.07,0:10:49.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It has a cool-down time.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:49.30,0:10:50.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't overuse it.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:51.09,0:10:51.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.97,0:10:58.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are we... in the mountains?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.42,0:10:58.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.38,0:11:01.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The house is still flooded,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.01,0:11:02.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so we came here first.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:05.95,0:11:06.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gen...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.11,0:11:07.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:08.40,0:11:11.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you think Piyu already made friends?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.57,0:11:12.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.53,0:11:14.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But there are few dumpling mice left.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.69,0:11:16.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What if he can't find others?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:16.77,0:11:19.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, he feels good here in the forest.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:20.40,0:11:21.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay then...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.07,0:11:26.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if he happened to be lonely...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.17,0:11:27.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.31,0:11:29.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,can we take him home?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.99,0:11:31.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The forest is his home.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:32.13,0:11:33.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laozi is at home all the time.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.05,0:11:35.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, he's bored to death.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.04,0:11:38.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:38.51,0:11:39.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't you afraid?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.11,0:11:41.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You and Xiaohei will protect me.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.16,0:11:43.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I will protect Piyu and Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.69,0:11:45.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:45.83,0:11:47.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you will be a good owner to Piyu.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:48.34,0:11:50.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's still waiting for you at the border stone.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:50.47,0:11:50.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:51.62,0:11:52.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:52.85,0:11:53.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:53.60,0:11:54.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go for him!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:55.28,0:11:55.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.12,0:12:05.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Careful!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:07.70,0:12:09.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Piyu!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:12.08,0:12:13.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Piyu!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.21,0:12:25.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Open it already...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.95,0:12:29.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't know how to face Xiaobai, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.87,0:12:31.54,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.07,0:12:32.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:33.44,0:12:34.79,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry about her?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:34.90,0:12:35.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:36.96,0:12:37.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.66,0:12:40.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Their feelings for each other...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.42,0:12:41.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,are worth to be cherished.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:42.39,0:12:43.33,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't get lost again!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.19,0:12:57.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You want me to leave here?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.26,0:12:59.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is your wish?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.06,0:13:00.48,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.03,0:13:06.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It goes against the vow I've made earlier.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:06.77,0:13:08.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I can't do that.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.59,0:13:09.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If he's not willing,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.88,0:13:10.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,don't push it.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:11.24,0:13:12.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just take the Pearl.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.99,0:13:13.96,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then I take the Pearl.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.38,0:13:15.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:15.89,0:13:18.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I suppose this wasn't {\i1}your{\i0} idea.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:18.69,0:13:19.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wuxian sent you, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:22.02,0:13:23.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank him for me.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.97,0:13:29.58,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:31.45,0:13:32.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can understand him!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:32.77,0:13:33.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How's this possible?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:34.46,0:13:36.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a form of telepathy.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.90,0:13:37.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How weird!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.18,0:13:39.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So others can't hear you?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:40.39,0:13:41.62,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I decide who I talk to.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.47,0:13:43.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is so very very cool!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:44.00,0:13:47.47,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Next time I have an exam, you sit under the window and tell me the answers!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.98,0:13:48.85,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not meant for that...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.85,0:13:50.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:50.65,0:13:51.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You got used to it quick.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.14,0:13:56.15,Episode title 13,,0,0,0,,{\fad(2000,0)\pos(1254,494)}Spirit force
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.44,0:13:54.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, how's your wound?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:54.59,0:13:55.42,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.73,0:14:06.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:08.68,0:14:09.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.07,0:14:12.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You brought Piyu too?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.15,0:14:12.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.95,0:14:14.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please don't eat the house :'(
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.73,0:14:15.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.62,0:14:17.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hi, Uncle San!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.32,0:14:17.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.52,0:14:17.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When did
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.94,0:14:18.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When did you
Dialogue: 1,0:14:18.10,0:14:18.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When did you come
Dialogue: 1,0:14:18.66,0:14:19.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When did you come back?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:19.64,0:14:20.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Four days ago.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.48,0:14:20.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.61,0:14:20.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I se
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.66,0:14:20.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.74,0:14:20.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I seee
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.82,0:14:20.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I seeee
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.99,0:14:22.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I seeeee!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.71,0:14:23.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just four days?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.94,0:14:25.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why does it seem longer to me?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:25.98,0:14:27.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because the software update took long?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.67,0:14:29.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:35.19,0:14:36.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So Xiaohei is a spirit too!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:37.09,0:14:38.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:38.37,0:14:40.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can call me Lil Bro Luo from now on.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.60,0:14:41.65,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm still the younger one...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.65,0:14:42.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.28,0:14:44.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Before I forget.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.14,0:14:45.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laozi sent you this.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.78,0:14:47.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hoho, the money's here!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.70,0:14:48.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't do this again.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:49.20,0:14:53.62,Text F,,0,0,0,,{\frz15.45\pos(892,830)}Got no money
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.34,0:14:53.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I demolish the village Laozi temple?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:53.49,0:14:54.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of you two...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.71,0:14:59.38,Text F,,0,0,0,,{\fs54\frz2\pos(798,540)}Got no money
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.71,0:14:59.38,Text F,,0,0,0,,{\frz2\fs40\pos(786,586)}Go to this place
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.62,0:14:56.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.99,0:14:57.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like a map.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.02,0:14:58.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.42,0:15:01.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's in the city.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.90,0:15:03.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So he wants us to go there?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:03.98,0:15:05.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What if it's a trap?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:05.37,0:15:05.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.21,0:15:10.81,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai! We cook dinner, you can take a bath first.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.01,0:15:11.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:21.09,0:15:22.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's so beautiful!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:22.88,0:15:24.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's like the sea.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.40,0:15:25.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:25.58,0:15:27.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In a few days it will be gone.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:27.18,0:15:28.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Luckily, the harvest is already over.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:34.58,0:15:37.19,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow we'll start training Piyu about what he can eat.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.86,0:15:38.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:39.04,0:15:40.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Piyu, be a good boy!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:43.18,0:15:44.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If Piyu's not a spirit,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:44.66,0:15:46.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,how come he can turn into a giant?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:46.74,0:15:49.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Spirit" is a name for a certain kind of lifeform.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:49.36,0:15:51.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But not only they can control spirit force.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:51.45,0:15:53.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In theory, all living things can do it.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:54.21,0:15:54.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:55.49,0:15:57.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laozi said too that a human can become god.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.36,0:16:00.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So even I could control water like you?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:00.70,0:16:01.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.09,0:16:02.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.87,0:16:03.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And how?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.07,0:16:05.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're interested?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:05.46,0:16:05.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.47,0:16:07.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.98,0:16:09.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everywhere around us
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.55,0:16:11.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,there's a legion of invisible beings,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:11.45,0:16:12.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,filling up space.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:13.47,0:16:15.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are material sprites and soulful sprites.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:16.24,0:16:17.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Soulful sprites can merge,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.85,0:16:19.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and become bodiless fairies.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:19.95,0:16:22.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They keep changing, absorbing more sprites,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.49,0:16:24.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,then combine with material sprites,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.24,0:16:26.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and so become beings with bodies.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:26.39,0:16:27.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These are called spirits.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:28.20,0:16:29.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As they are born from sprites,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.64,0:16:32.12,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,they're naturally better at controlling spirit force.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.48,0:16:35.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You remember Master Lao's realm?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.30,0:16:35.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.91,0:16:37.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Spirit space is the key to spirit force.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:37.83,0:16:40.75,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,By cultivation, attributes of the spirit space can be changed.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.98,0:16:43.89,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,And those who have no spirit space, they can't even do that?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.04,0:16:45.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Every living thing has one.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.65,0:16:48.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We absorb sprites with every breath.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.14,0:16:51.76,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Then how come I don't know any other person like you?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:52.34,0:16:54.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It all depends on innate properties.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:55.80,0:16:56.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.46,0:16:57.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:57.42,0:16:58.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, cool!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.74,0:17:01.63,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,If a human spends decades with mastering ice magic,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.63,0:17:03.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,this is the level they can reach.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.34,0:17:04.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But an ice type spirit
Dialogue: 1,0:17:04.99,0:17:06.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is capable of much more from its birth.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.11,0:17:09.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So even in old times, few people cultivated.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:09.32,0:17:11.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not to mention modern times.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:11.50,0:17:14.91,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,But didn't Laozi say today's mightiest god had been a human?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.07,0:17:17.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He did. I talk about ordinary people.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:17.41,0:17:19.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course, there are always naturals.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:19.51,0:17:21.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The skills depend on the size of the spirit space.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:22.08,0:17:24.71,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,An ordinary person has one about the size of a basketball.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:24.92,0:17:25.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about yours?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:26.00,0:17:27.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now it's about...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:27.48,0:17:29.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the size of a soccer field.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:30.01,0:17:31.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it beautiful too?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:31.44,0:17:32.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:32.72,0:17:34.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'd freeze to death in mine.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.69,0:17:35.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's an icy hell.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:35.84,0:17:36.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.09,0:17:38.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And how big is Laozi's space?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:39.11,0:17:40.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We didn't see all of it, or?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:40.64,0:17:42.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In fact it's just the size of Blue Creek.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.11,0:17:44.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about Mt. Laojun?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:44.24,0:17:45.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't it in the space?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.78,0:17:46.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On the back of Blue Creek.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:47.11,0:17:47.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.31,0:17:50.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Imagine the spirit space is a sphere.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:50.32,0:17:52.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Blue Creek is in one side of the sphere.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:52.34,0:17:53.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Under it is Starry Night Lake.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:53.77,0:17:54.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mt. Laojun is here.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:55.11,0:17:56.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inbetween, the four palaces.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:56.93,0:17:59.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the physical laws defined by Master Lao,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.04,0:18:00.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,each has its own direction of gravity.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:00.90,0:18:02.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
