Dialogue: 1,0:18:02.49,0:18:03.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:04.92,0:18:06.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did you eat it?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.61,0:18:07.66,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now I'm a babysitter...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.63,0:18:09.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was wondering.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:09.33,0:18:10.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, what's your power?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.27,0:18:11.93,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll see when I'm cured.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.98,0:18:14.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then be healthy soon!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.03,0:18:18.53,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Next, we'll cover spirit force and subspace abilities in the spirit space.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.85,0:18:20.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't follow you anymore...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.54,0:18:22.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then I'll continue slower.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:31.37,0:18:33.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These summer nights are so nice!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.65,0:18:34.23,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:34.75,0:18:37.09,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,With Master Lao's cure, you'll recover in a month.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:37.34,0:18:38.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will you leave here then?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:39.11,0:18:39.90,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:40.71,0:18:41.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's fine not to know.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:42.02,0:18:43.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have time to decide.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:43.49,0:18:45.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But some troubles may come to you...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:45.78,0:18:46.42,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What troubles?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.02,0:18:47.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:48.09,0:18:49.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Sky Pearl invites trouble.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:51.70,0:18:52.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.16,0:18:56.51,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Somebody's coming.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.14,0:19:06.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.35,0:19:47.73,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Stay with me aruite yukou ishikoro wo kette\NStay with me - let's walk on, kicking pebbles as we go
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.73,0:19:52.47,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Yukisaki wa kitto kimagure demo \NOur destination may be whimsical
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.47,0:19:57.17,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Hana no kaori wo ryoute ni\NBut with the scent of flowers in both hands
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.17,0:20:03.37,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,kore kara deau kimi e to\NI’ll carry it to the you I’ve yet to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.37,0:20:09.52,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Wait for me hanashi wo shiyou kata wo narabete\NWait for me — let’s talk, side by side
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.52,0:20:14.32,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Hajimemashite wa gikochinaku temo\NEven if our first “hello” is a little awkward
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.32,0:20:19.00,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Mochiyotta hako aketara\NWhen we open the boxes we’ve brought
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.00,0:20:25.52,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Tsumekon da yume wo wakeaou\NLet’s share the dreams we’ve packed inside
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.52,0:20:36.84,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Mata ashita tte atarimae ni kawaseru hibi ga\NThe days when we can casually say “See you tomorrow”
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.84,0:20:42.26,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Itoshikute hakanasugite\NAre so precious and so fleeting
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.26,0:20:47.30,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Omoi wa kitto kienai\NThose feelings will never fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.30,0:20:58.53,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Sora wo nagareru kumo ni wa oitsukenai kedo\NWe can’t catch up to the clouds drifting across the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.53,0:21:04.08,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Ame ni natte hana wo tsukete kitto boku wo yonderu\NBut they’ll turn to rain, bloom into flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.08,0:21:10.92,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Kitto boku wo yonderu\N And surely, they’re calling out to me
